      "text": "I have carefully considered the above referred submissions and and i find merit in the above referred arguments of learned counsel for applicants that not only the police inquiry report under Section 202(1) Cr.P.C. was not considered, even statements, recorded under Section 202 Cr.P.C.,\nwas also not considered, even in brief.",
